{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_05_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7aca20e4c92e073da30af3ae569c891010727b9e384cdcaae49bac06a06a2216",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91c92d95416a9bb51d761ce423f01eace415db763cf3c47d748b76747d55f1e9",
      "text": "呵呵。大家原来\n都曾沉迷于自己最喜欢的事物呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa8dc523c72a30568c4113c4c68cf472ac6573c3461248154915751d936644ad",
      "text": "是啊。但是……今后我也依然打算\n将自己全身心奉献给艺道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d49d9b6aa42df90a34cfbc2e5abca10e2a23863dadc4afa6496c9627803d9d9",
      "text": "两位也是如此吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba950dd6da31a0298b20483bd2f476b154ba2629e2a4c91dba953af36681835e",
      "text": "那不是理所当然的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8469efae0c55174fd906645d265ebf2c19b18a84c908a825426537d0cb15e401",
      "text": "当然喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9a4f37b60793ab136dc141cc675f725be35ad4c404f7eca6a1e0109b648617d",
      "text": "我们的生存之道是相同的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bba59a81334a00fdd4304cbde4bf2e549e76f409650cd75a99b53656ae1e224",
      "text": "能够奇迹般地与这样的同志相遇。\n这份缘分，让我想要再一次致以谢意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cdb8318715bf966f5bf1f8b822858ee4354886a382dce3d67b06f0c4548bc5e",
      "text": "喵喵……！在下的心跳，\n总觉得扑通扑通停不下来了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b042b38f148dd20bd4b1d4d610a0cc769a3d3e9a46d16f0b878d6beae56924f",
      "text": "今后也要三人一直一直在一起，\n在偶像与艺道上走下去喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d71aec42846a0e45d79eede86a23fea0cba309150c4484573be64faac27951a9",
      "text": "……我们如今能全心全意地活着，\n也是因为先辈们留下了那样精湛的技艺。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b60306881d7f6af3b2a6c5cb04a77bf8bc116ab068587af11a28393659e2427",
      "text": "跨越时空，持续闪耀。\n照亮着他人的人生……这真的很了不起呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d7da8bdce9832abc6cf07470d46815ab3ee960deb20a080f97e1d71ff2f8406",
      "text": "为了报答这份恩情，留在此处的这封信里的光芒，\n我们也必须传达给更多的人才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4d73dfd5ceb7cfe7aa2b84e13786ee4be16a359d76efd38a0c8b05304343fb0",
      "text": "好了好了。大家一起来学习、学习喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000156:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7823f8c3b6be94411f17c1968ba69b64e83c516fdefe2ddece84d5a8321a6435",
      "text": "当天晚上……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000168:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0146755f5cfd3fc303d5fe2316365d59cb46504e275726746bb6e32ce40bf69",
      "text": "九郎君、蝴蝶先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000170:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62548cc8350a3a13e2dcf8b6c3ce9c21d0fd16647bc207fb5bef3818f0573274",
      "text": "一起买的同款钥匙扣\n挂在哪里了喵<emoji>image_talk_emoji_03</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000172:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7228566a3ce5acc0714bc77864f7e12d015219e43b2f06acafbb694d32d23a60",
      "text": "我挂在化妆包上了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000174:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eab1c03f058f93632eecbbd96a842a6cf41e7cc8e4df0adb86dde3e1c6226d93",
      "text": "钥匙扣的颜色\n和化妆包的设计\n绝配呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000176:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffd17b68ceb8f1b98b25dbb150181023abcbdf6644b8b394bd4c720cbd13e971",
      "text": "我挂在工作用的\n笔袋上了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000178:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26d3535a742fdb0e2d42dbbf2835e2896de875df79bece04c2c2753ae974108b",
      "text": "这样的话，\n随时都能看得到。\n猫柳先生呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000180:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f59f75082c14d8c91b22548f68e8e8a141c501724ffb8898cd8fc4cfd98d39f",
      "text": "在下挂在束口袋上了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000182:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a762936b2b0b25ddfa62b6a6a098739e9fc81405e262b6f4029478148db76ee",
      "text": "这样无论何时何地\n都能随身携带了喵<emoji>image_talk_emoji_05</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000184:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2d8b58130280811e0661a961126e0317349754685c311dbd49d97fa371f4f1f",
      "text": "刚开始虽然觉得\n有点害羞，但用同款物件\n确实是件好事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000186:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8ed95e89dc433f2cc5239561da560ca241f25947302845222889e83a195341f",
      "text": "就是说嘛。\n保持这股劲头团结一致，\n录制也要加油哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000188:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54e4e48fe845801a5e3ba1f4103703ee392a29227b69909a8e283ceba0ce3058",
      "text": "期待各位的表现！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000188:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6da85ef9c838befbe3b1ccd8c3659ee06abe5e1b3fb9c625f3d5c3c25b3298b9",
      "text": "期待各位的\n大显身手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000189:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b97842fa8ccf5c3b155bb1dfce40f44f2d320cbb5a8cf8252f98275a3ee16d0f",
      "text": "敬请期待！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000189:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a2482ac83cb0f84c39af49114261723c4d32724f516765974fc78da0403d3a9",
      "text": "我很期待各位\n会如何演唱这首歌！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000193:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db36adae5fb438c47412ba841c6ded756b44054ae3d2384486f9578f27c4d9c4",
      "text": "好的。我们会为大家呈现出\n最精彩的舞台。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000205:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14eaaed16f3b3cb15a464f8d455c33f196c1f51de91a324493de208201723834",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君，\n刚才忘记跟你说了喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000207:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96ad22aae17bc7bfd9f78cac1254d04f1f21f7826b0193d8fa0cf0a3ca685667",
      "text": "彩的大家一起给●●●●プロデューサー君\n买了伴手礼喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000209:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f60eab5bfeec1270f64d9af59e40d60994bcbeed898febb0c8d60badc044d616",
      "text": "已经送到事务所了，请查收喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000211:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2637a5c7e04f9a056a5febd6ae5b883e24db3ae6cfac0e492cd07c5e291aca27",
      "text": "什么时候买的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000214:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48afc7880b8ea097359d8afc7bd4c01e4c7b7863289843751fa131ddad5ad589",
      "text": "喵呼呼，趁着●●●●プロデューサー君打工作电话\n的时候，偷偷买下的……喵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000216:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21b2ba1811e66eef3e01a48e589b379c48c9efa25b3a8354c7e883e04351ba73",
      "text": "谢谢你们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000219:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41bfe2c461d5a22225746237160d9b5024ec0090d2eba8c964cd058163f93b6f",
      "text": "该说谢谢的是在下喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000221:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b61ecda29a7456955fb03231581515a7a100d640ab2835fbfc95082f0cae19f3",
      "text": "多亏●●●●プロデューサー君让在下能和九郎君\n以及蝴蝶先生组成组合，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000223:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7c64cee15ef17254dc90f455d4a1dbc7cff1a5981f16f0820b465ed2c2f1e36",
      "text": "在下每天都过得超级开心喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000225:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22f0b7aec6eb5aa1b1bc28ca7137d97c7e4e2438eed7f34dd003b54f645fef18",
      "text": "今后大家也要一起度过\n让人心潮澎湃的每一天喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000227:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b08573c9ddf5d93fb15ae73d1c2d2e79cd6398bfab18bf0c3c5300c403d8b5d7",
      "text": "那么，在下就先告辞了。\n明天见喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
